        "## Cross-Model Interpretation\n",
        "\n",
        "When we place both comparison tables side by side, the headline finding of\n",
        "this robustness check becomes clear:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Strategy | LR PR-AUC | LR F2 | LR MCC | RF PR-AUC | RF F2 | RF MCC |\n",
        "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
        "| Control (no treatment) | 0.3510 | 0.2137 | 0.3525 | 0.8146 | 0.7389 | 0.7761 |\n",
        "| Class Weights | 0.3556 | 0.0805 | 0.1005 | 0.8181 | 0.7390 | 0.7744 |\n",
        "| SMOTE | 0.3560 | 0.0805 | 0.1005 | 0.7458 | 0.7612 | 0.6807 |\n",
        "| Focal Loss (alpha=0.9, gamma=2.0) | 0.3577 | 0.3837 | 0.4369 | not applicable | — | — |\n",
        "\n",
        "Random Forest's untreated Control result exceeds every Logistic Regression\n",
        "variant we tested, including our best-performing, explicitly tuned Focal\n",
        "Loss configuration, on every metric. We think this is the most\n",
        "consequential finding of this comparison: for this dataset and feature set,\n",
        "model architecture appears to matter substantially more than\n",
        "imbalance-handling strategy. A carefully tuned strategy on a weaker model\n",
